WEBVTT

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.410
Who are you?!

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.990
I am Barian.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.030
Barian?

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.490
Did you just say you're Barian?!

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:25.330
That's right. I came here in order to annihilate Astral World,

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.210
as the messenger from Barian World!

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.130
So that's Barian?

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.090
Barian...

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:46.520
See for yourself!
Heart-eartH Dragon's effect!

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:52.070
When this Monster with is destroyed while it has no Overlay Units,

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.490
It can be revived only once.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.570
The resurrected Heart-eartH Dragon's Attack Power increases

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:01.450
by 1000 points for each card that has been Banished.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.660
4000 Attack Points?!

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:09.850
Furthermore, when Heart-eartH Dragon is Special Summoned successfully,

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:14.300
all Monsters on my opponent's field are switched to Defense Mode!

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.090
Impossible...Neo Galaxy-Eyes was...

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:21.810
Kaito!

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.370
It's still too soon for you to collapse.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:29.020
Here goes! It's my turn! Draw!

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:32.740
I activate a Continuous Spell, Barian's Gateway!

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:35.900
This turn, each time a card is sent to the Graveyard...

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.360
...you will receive 800 points of damage!

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.410
What!?

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:42.620
Not good! We only have 100 of our Life left...

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:45.240
And now you're doomed!

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:47.330
Go, Heart-eartH Dragon!

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:49.960
Attack Neo Galaxy-Eyes!

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.670
Heartbreak Cannon!

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:59.840
I activate a Trap! Photon Escape!

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:03.860
With this card, when a Photon Monster is attacked,

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:06.810
I can Banish that Monster and end the battle!

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.900
You still have some strength left to struggle,

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.770
But at this moment,

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:17.690
For every Banished card, Heart-eartH Dragon gains 1000 Attack Points!

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.950
5000 Attack Points?!

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:23.160
Haruto...

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.840
K-Kaito...

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:34.960
Barian!

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:38.920
If you've come here to take Haruto away, just try it!

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:41.690
I'll finish things here and now!

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:45.700
HARUTO!

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.310
Brother...

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:51.810
I activate Dimension Wanderer’s Monster Effect from my hand!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:56.900
When a Monster is Banished, by sending this card from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:02.200
I can inflict damage to my opponent equal to the total Attack Points of the Banished Monsters!

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:07.200
The Monsters I target are Shark Drake Weiss and Neo Galaxy-Eyes!

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:11.670
Therefore, the total damage you receive is 7300 points!

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.330
That's amazing, Kaito!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:16.130
So I still had something like this up his sleeve.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.510
This is my final strike!

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.840
Ryouga!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.130
Right!

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.340
Take this attack that transcends dimensions!

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.180
Go, Neo Galaxy-Eyes!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:32.140
Ultimate Photon Stream!!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.190
Go, Shark Drake Weiss!

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.740
Depth Chaos Bite!!

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.670
Hmph. Very nice move, Kaito.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:58.710
I activate another effect of the Continuous Magic, Barian’s Gateway!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:03.760
By sending this card to the Graveyard, I can negate the opposing Monster’s effect!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.430
He managed to avoid my strike?

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.360
Hey, Kaito! Are you alright? Hey!

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:18.940
Sha-Shark!

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.910
I set one card and end my turn!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:31.250
What a pity. Now you're the only one left, Yuma Tsukumo.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:43.850
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:49.400
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:06.100
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:11.800
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:16.410
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:22.230
<i>It's too soon for us to turn back now</i>

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:27.630
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:32.910
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:38.870
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:44.280
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:49.450
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:54.890
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:05:56.200 --> 00:06:01.280
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:07.300
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.260
Your remaining Life is almost as good as gone.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.600
Not to mention you don't have any Monsters on your field.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:19.730
"Number 71: The Miraculous 'Bring it to 'Em'!
Open a Path to the Future, ZEXAL!"

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.730
Alright, Yuma Tsukumo,

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.650
Despair along with the Astral World!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.610
You all can just vanish into the depth of darkness!

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:25.030
Darn it! Not in a place like this...!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.150
Yuma... Brother...

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.780
Yuma... Brother...

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.910
Always for my sake... For me...

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.670
Wha...What's happening?!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.170
Haruto...

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.810
This is...

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.490
Haruto... You...

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.120
Haruto… You little…

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:17.240
Don't tell me he's using the power of Barian I gave him…?!

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.880
Impossible! The Sphere Field is...

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.750
Yuma, do it now!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.800
Go to Astral!

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.550
Kaito?

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:29.970
Yuma...

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.590
Let him see the power you share with Astral!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:34.760
Shark...

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.470
Yuma... Yuma...

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.310
Astral!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.450
Here I come!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.000
Yuma!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.880
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:08.300
Yuma!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.010
Astral!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:12.550
I Overlay with you!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.810
I build the Overlay Network with the two of us!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.310
When two distant souls intersect,

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.400
The generational force shall appear!

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.360
Xyz Change...!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.420
ZEXAL!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.540
That's...

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.210
The power Yuma and Astral share with each other!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:50.050
ZEXAL!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:56.760
So you are the force from Astral World, ZEXAL!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:01.140
Barian! Even if you stand in our way,

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.390
The hope that shines within the darkness...

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:07.610
...will defeat you along with the Bring it to 'em that burns inside my chest!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.070
My turn!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:12.820
The strongest Duelists can even choose the cards they draw!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.530
This is the card of our destiny!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.870
SHINING DRAW!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.630
I Summon ZEXAL Weapon - Ultimate Shield!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:38.640
I activate Ultimate Shield’s effect!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.810
When this card is Summoned,

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.890
By negating the effects of up to three Banished Xyz Monsters,

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:47.060
they can be Special Summoned in Defense Position!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.350
What did you just say?!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.650
Revive! Chaos Number 39!

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.610
Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.530
Yuma, let's go!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.450
Integrate our power as one!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.410
Roar! Chaos Number 32!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:10.330
Shark Drake Weiss!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.380
Be reborn, my very soul!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.470
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:24.810
Additionally, because these three Banished Monsters have returned to the field,

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:28.770
Heart-eartH Dragon loses 3000 Attack Power!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:33.650
Did you see? This is the true power of our combined strength!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.070
You just keep screwing around!

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:37.950
But your end will not change!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.530
Behold!

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:40.740
What?

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:44.870
The Sphere Field Cannon is...?!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.580
Astral may have escaped,

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.620
but the Sphere Field Cannon already has enough energy.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:54.880
You cannot stop it now, no matter what you do!

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:04.260
You can all just vanish together with the Astral World!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:05.850
Go, Yuma!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:08.230
We will leave everything to you!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.690
Beat him down!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:15.070
Right! I equip Hope Ray with Ultimate Shield!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.940
With this, Hope Ray gains 2000 Defense Points!

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:30.580
Furthermore, I activate the Equip Magic, Xyz Unity, from my hand!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.880
Thanks to this card’s effect,

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.170
Hope Ray is switched to Attack Position!

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:41.130
Then during this turn, Hope Ray gains Attack Points equal to the total Attack Power of

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.470
all Defense Position Monsters on my field!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.810
Therefore, his Attack Power is now 9800!

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.640
What did you say?!

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.640
Go! Hope Ray!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:57.150
It’s useless! Regardless of how much you may have raised his Attack Power,

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:00.530
Heart-eartH Dragon is able to negate the battle damage,

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.320
and bounce it back to all of you!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.030
I activate another effect of the Xyz Unity Equip Magic!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:11.460
I send Shark Drake Weiss to the Graveyard using this effect...

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.920
...allowing Hope Ray to attack once again...

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.710
...letting it attack you directly!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.800
Dream on!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:22.130
I activate the Permanent Trap, Barian's Battle Buster!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.590
By Banishing a Barian card from my Graveyard, this card's effect

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.270
allows me to negate a Monster's attack up to twice per turn!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.850
By Banishing Barian's Gateway,

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.100
I can negate your Direct Attack!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.240
Tch, I'm not done!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:47.370
I send Neo-Galaxy Eyes to the Graveyard to attack once more...

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.950
...giving you another Direct Attack!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:56.130
How foolish! I activate the effect of the Permanent Trap, Barian’s Battle Buster!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.040
Your Direct Attack is negated!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:04.130
Then, by sending Barian’s Battle Buster to the Graveyard,

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.760
Monsters on the field are forced to battle!

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:11.390
Shoot! If Hope Ray battles as things are...

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.730
6800 damage will bounce back to us!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:27.200
Now it's <i>truly</i> over!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.370
Go to hell!

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.830
You think so?

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.040
What?!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.500
I activate Ultimate Shield’s effect!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.920
When this card is used as an Equip card, all Effect Damage is negated,

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.710
and this card gains Attack Power equal to that amount of damage!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:47.970
Additionally, it negates all of Heart-eartH Dragon's effects!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:54.930
Impossible... Impossible... IMPOSSIBLE!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:01.400
Take this attack worth 16600 points!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:08.030
Go, Hope Ray! Attack Heart-eartH Dragon and Barian!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.410
Hope Sword Ultimate Slash!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:30.180
Damn you... bastards!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:34.140
Did you see that, Barian?! This is our bond!

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:38.980
Dad!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.030
Haruto!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:54.950
Yuma!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.630
Haruto!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.050
Haruto!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.140
B-Brother...

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.390
You're fine now.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:19.100
All of your nightmares have completely vanished.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.150
Shark!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.610
Kotori! Kotori!!

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.990
Orbital! How long do you plan to keep sleeping?!

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.490
Orbital Seven!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.870
A-As you wish!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.880
I...

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.000
Kaito.

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.170
Kaito!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:51.800
Father! Father!!

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.970
Orbital, take care of Haruto!

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.180
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, you aren't...!

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.860
Brother! Brother!!

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:10.570
I will bring my dad back! I swear that I will!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:13.030
Kotori, take care of everyone!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:13.990
Huh?

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.700
You're going?

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:17.910
Yup.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.830
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.720
Where are you, Dad?

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.140
Dad!

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.030
K-Kaito...

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:52.530
Dad!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.490
Yuma?!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:09.130
Why, Yuma Tskumo? Why are you helping me?

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.380
You may be detestable...

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:15.720
But you did your best to save Haruto.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:20.100
Any good father would shrug it off with a,
 "Can't be helped", and a smile.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.730
You've done enough, Yuma.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.940
I have committed far too many sins.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.660
I should not be forgiven.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.410
Dad!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.160
That’s right.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.040
You have indeed committed too many sins.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.750
Tron!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.010
Yuma...

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.760
YUMA!

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:02.600
Tron… Stop, Tron!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.680
Your revenge is already over!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.310
B-Byron...

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:16.110
I beg you, Bryon.
 Kaito and the others have nothing to do with this.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.780
Everything is my fault.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:19.780
Dad!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.620
Stop, Tron!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:30.250
Tron!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:36.050
This is the last... of my power!

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:55.110
It’s aright. It's gonna be alright!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:59.200
Because Yuma always...

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.330
Huh? I...

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.960
Y-Yo, Kotori!

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.880
Yuma! Astral!

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:24.600
Dad! Brother!

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.390
Hey, what are you crying about?

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.680
Hey, Kotori!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:32.310
Geez, you really <i>are</i> an idiot!

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.900
You always...<i>always</i> make me worry!

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:41.740
Byron...

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:48.500
<i>Byron.</i>

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.670
<i>Faker.</i>

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.790
<i>I'm sorry, Byron.</i>

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.010
<i>Farewell, my friend.</i>

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:14.440
To think you'd actually forgive me, Byron...

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.820
You are so reckless and keep pulling crazy stunts!

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.570
It couldn't be helped!

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:21.490
What do you mean “it couldn’t be helped”?!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.700
How's his spirit holding up, Droite?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:32.120
I already administered first aid, but we still must hurry, Gauche.

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:32.960
Gotcha!

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:37.130
I'm counting on you, Gauche, Droite.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:42.760
I'm sorry. Everything is my fault.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.260
It’s all due to me.

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:48.760
Forgive me, Haruto, Kaito.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:55.400
<i>Yuma, your heart that never gives up, and the trust you place in the bonds with your friends...</i>

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:59.150
<i>...has brought the light of hope back to everyone.</i>

00:20:59.150 --> 00:20:59.690
<i>Thank you. </i>

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:04.650
So I guess the Duel Carnival is over now.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.660
No, it‘s still not over yet!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:10.870
I still haven’t received my prize for winning the Duel Carnival!

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:14.330
Wa…wait… What are you saying at a time like this?!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:20.710
The winner of the Duel Carnival is to be granted whatever wish they have.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:27.680
And mine is for Kaito and his family to live together in happiness and in peace!

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.310
It's none of your business.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:38.270
Wh-What?!

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:40.980
I <i>said</i> that it's none of your business.

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:44.570
Alright, alright, I got it!

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:47.240
In that case, here's my <i>real</i> wish!

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:50.990
Kaito, you and I still haven’t settled the score yet!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:51.990
Duel with me!

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:55.460
I see. Interesting.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.670
I guess we can call this the <i>real</i> Final.

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:00.880
Very well. I accept.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.920
Yuma, Astral!

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:09.180
Great! I'm gonna bring it to ya!

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:15.600
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:21.230
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:31.950
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.210
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.840
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.390
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:05.480
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:16.240
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:21.830
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:27.090
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:32.590
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:43.860
The final round of the World Duel Carnival is finally over!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:46.440
But the true Final still hasn't started!

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:47.530
Isn't that right, Kaito?

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:50.700
The time has come to settle the score with our battle!

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:53.280
His strength is far greater than before.

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:55.490
This Duel's making my chest throb with excitement!

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
Kaito... You aren't really...!

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:00.410
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:05.380
"The Ultimate Showdown Has Come!!
 Yuma VS Kaito: The Other WDC Final!"
